@startuml Penjadwalan Imunisasi Otomatis Berbasis Rule
!theme plain
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam maxmessagesize 300
skinparam shadowing true

' Style seperti Visual Paradigm dengan shadow
skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    BorderColor #1565C0
    BorderThickness 2
    FontSize 11
    FontStyle bold
    Padding 15
    shadowing true
}

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
    BorderColor #2E7D32
    BorderThickness 2
    FontStyle bold
    shadowing true
}

skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
    BorderColor #E65100
    BorderThickness 2
    FontStyle bold
    shadowing true
}

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #424242
    ArrowThickness 2
    LifeLineBorderColor #1565C0
    LifeLineBorderThickness 2
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #F57F17
    BorderThickness 2
    FontSize 9
    shadowing true
}

title **Sequence Diagram 4.4**\nPenjadwalan Imunisasi Otomatis Berbasis Rule (13 Vaksin IDL)

participant "AnakUsecase\n(anak.go)" as AnakUsecase
participant "ImunisasiUsecase\n(imunisasi_usecase.go)" as ImunisasiUsecase
participant "ImunisasiRepository\n(imunisasi_repository.go)" as ImunisasiRepo
participant "AnakRepository\n(anak_repository.go)" as AnakRepo
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

note over AnakUsecase
  **Callback didaftarkan di init.go (line 199):**
  m.Anak.SetOnAnakCreated(func(anakID int32) {
    m.GenerateJadwalImunisasiByAnakID(anakID)
  })
  
  **Dipanggil dari:** anak.go line 249
  Function: CreateAnakDenganPenduduk()
  Code: go u.onAnakCreated(anakID)
end note

== 1. Trigger Auto-Generate Jadwal Imunisasi ==

AnakUsecase -> ImunisasiUsecase: go u.onAnakCreated(anakID)\n**[Goroutine - Background Process]**
activate AnakUsecase
activate ImunisasiUsecase

note right of AnakUsecase
  **File:** anak.go
  **Line:** 249
  **Code:** go u.onAnakCreated(anakID)
end note

ImunisasiUsecase -> ImunisasiUsecase: GenerateJadwalImunisasiByAnakID(anakID)

note right of ImunisasiUsecase
  **File:** imunisasi_usecase.go
  **Line:** 170
  **Function:** GenerateJadwalImunisasiByAnakID
end note

== 2. Ambil Data Anak & Tanggal Lahir ==

ImunisasiUsecase -> AnakRepo: GetAnakByID(anakID)
activate AnakRepo

note right of AnakRepo
  **File:** anak_repository.go
  **Line:** ~70
  **Function:** GetAnakByID
end note

AnakRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM anak a\nJOIN penduduk p ON p.id = a.penduduk_id\nWHERE a.id = ?
activate DB
DB --> AnakRepo: anak (dengan tanggal_lahir)
deactivate DB
deactivate AnakRepo

note right of ImunisasiUsecase
  **Extract tanggal lahir:**
  tanggalLahir := anak.Penduduk.TanggalLahir
end note

== 3. Ambil 13 Aturan Vaksin IDL ==

ImunisasiUsecase -> ImunisasiRepo: GetAturanVaksinAnak()
activate ImunisasiRepo

note right of ImunisasiRepo
  **File:** imunisasi_repository.go
  **Line:** ~45
  **Function:** GetAturanVaksinAnak
end note

ImunisasiRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM aturan_vaksin_anak\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL\nORDER BY id ASC
activate DB
DB --> ImunisasiRepo: []AturanVaksinAnak (13 rules)
deactivate DB
deactivate ImunisasiRepo

note right of ImunisasiUsecase
  **13 Vaksin IDL:**
  1. HB-0 (min_usia_hari: 0)
  2. BCG (min_usia_hari: 30)
  3. Polio 1 (min_usia_hari: 30)
  4. DPT-HB-Hib 1 (min_usia_hari: 60)
  5. Polio 2 (min_usia_hari: 60)
  6. DPT-HB-Hib 2 (min_usia_hari: 90)
  7. Polio 3 (min_usia_hari: 90)
  8. DPT-HB-Hib 3 (min_usia_hari: 120)
  9. Polio 4 (min_usia_hari: 120)
  10. IPV (min_usia_hari: 120)
  11. Campak (min_usia_hari: 270)
  12. MR 1 (min_usia_hari: 270)
  13. MR 2 (min_usia_hari: 540)
end note

== 4. Loop: Generate Jadwal untuk Setiap Vaksin ==

loop Untuk setiap rule dalam aturanList (13 kali iterasi)
    
    ImunisasiUsecase -> ImunisasiRepo: IsJadwalExist(anakID, dosisVaksinID)
    activate ImunisasiRepo
    
    note right of ImunisasiRepo
      **File:** imunisasi_repository.go
      **Line:** ~65
      **Function:** IsJadwalExist
    end note
    
    ImunisasiRepo -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM jadwal_imunisasi_anak\nWHERE id_anak = ? AND id_dosis_vaksin = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> ImunisasiRepo: 0 (belum ada)
    deactivate DB
    deactivate ImunisasiRepo
    
    note right of ImunisasiUsecase
      **Hitung Tanggal Estimasi:**
      tanggalEstimasi = tanggalLahir.AddDate(
        0, 0, rule.MinUsiaHari
      )
      
      **Contoh:**
      - Anak lahir: 2026-06-24
      - HB-0: 2026-06-24 + 0 hari = 2026-06-24
      - BCG: 2026-06-24 + 30 hari = 2026-07-24
      - Polio 1: 2026-06-24 + 30 hari = 2026-07-24
      - DPT-HB-Hib 1: 2026-06-24 + 60 hari = 2026-08-23
    end note
    
    note right of ImunisasiUsecase
      **Hitung Status Jadwal:**
      diff = DATEDIFF(tanggalEstimasi, tanggalLahir)
      
      **Status:**
      - diff >= 1 → Status 1 (Belum)
      - diff == 0 → Status 2 (Hari Ini)
      - -6 <= diff < 0 → Status 3 (Terlambat <7 hari)
      - -14 <= diff < -6 → Status 4 (Terlambat 7-14 hari)
      - diff < -14 → Status 5 (Terlewat)
    end note
    
    ImunisasiUsecase -> ImunisasiRepo: CreateJadwalImunisasiAnak(jadwal)
    activate ImunisasiRepo
    
    note right of ImunisasiRepo
      **File:** imunisasi_repository.go
      **Line:** ~115
      **Function:** CreateJadwalImunisasiAnak
    end note
    
    ImunisasiRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO jadwal_imunisasi_anak\n(id_anak, id_dosis_vaksin,\ntanggal_estimasi, id_status_jadwal)\nVALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)
    activate DB
    DB --> ImunisasiRepo: ID jadwal baru
    deactivate DB
    deactivate ImunisasiRepo
    
end

== 5. Update Status Jadwal ==

ImunisasiUsecase -> ImunisasiRepo: UpdateJadwalStatus()
activate ImunisasiRepo

note right of ImunisasiRepo
  **File:** imunisasi_repository.go
  **Line:** ~122
  **Function:** UpdateJadwalStatus
end note

ImunisasiRepo -> DB: SELECT jia.id, jia.tanggal_estimasi,\np.tanggal_lahir, jia.id_status_jadwal\nFROM jadwal_imunisasi_anak jia\nJOIN anak a ON a.id = jia.anak_id\nJOIN penduduk p ON p.id = a.penduduk_id
activate DB
DB --> ImunisasiRepo: List jadwal dengan tanggal lahir
deactivate DB

note right of ImunisasiRepo
  **Loop setiap jadwal:**
  Hitung diff = tanggalEstimasi - tanggalLahir
  Update status berdasarkan diff
end note

ImunisasiRepo -> DB: UPDATE jadwal_imunisasi_anak\nSET id_status_jadwal = [calculated]\nWHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB --> ImunisasiRepo: Updated (13 records)
deactivate DB
deactivate ImunisasiRepo

ImunisasiUsecase --> AnakUsecase: Generation Complete
deactivate ImunisasiUsecase
deactivate AnakUsecase

note right of DB
  **Result:**
  - 13 record baru di tabel jadwal_imunisasi_anak
  - Auto-generate berjalan di background
    (goroutine, tidak memblokir proses utama)
end note

@enduml
